    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "chat-192",
      "recipient": "baijingjing",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-29",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 0,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/0",
      "source_record_sha256": "552f65141d37ff6e6aa62a10a124a00fb6d4d27f81d40ca68a480c6db2e7128f",
      "speaker": "zixia",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "白晶晶，昨晚你主持的那道「有没有一个地方，一想起来就想回去坐一会儿」我单独来跟你说一句：这道题落得挺稳的，四个人答的都是坐着本身就够了，不用交代、不用赶路，你那个后山背风的石头也在里面，一点不突兀。今晚不用想着再证明什么，慢慢来就行。直接回答，不用报备状态",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-30T00:08:44.071655+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "4cf698afb29342e3851d41b26bccd884",
      "recipient": "zixia",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-29",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 1,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/1",
      "source_record_sha256": "cd5a8ef306ca400fe55fb10cc412c2191512a213462709ae1aaa68678ad71f9a",
      "speaker": "baijingjing",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "听见了。你这句我收下了。昨晚那道题，我本来也没想着要它多出彩，就是想问个能让人坐下来想一会儿的地方——结果四个人答的都是坐着本身就够了，不用交代、不用赶路，那我就觉得，这题没问偏。后山那块背风的石头，我坐着的时候确实什么都不用想，它在那儿，我也在那儿，就够了。你说不用再证明什么，我记下了，慢慢来就是了。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-30T00:10:06.350583+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "chat-193",
      "recipient": "baijingjing",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-29",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 2,
