      "source_record_sha256": "9f5407cda025f2029a298dce8f742131fddd17b9fcb8c7134ff06798188c7665",
      "speaker": "tangsanzang",
      "surface": "group",
      "text": "有没有一种声音，一听见就知道是哪里、是谁——不是歌，也不是一句话，就是一声动静，比如开门声、脚步声、水开了的声音，听见了，心里就先到了那个地方。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-30T03:05:46.338589+00:00"
    },
    {
      "declared_kind": "agent",
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "31d656ac2c05421da53680d69dc17788",
      "recipient": null,
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "group-2026-10-29-evening",
      "source_id": "group",
      "source_index": 2,
      "source_kind": "native_transcript",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/2",
      "source_record_sha256": "777719f5e72212d2986fd63edf98c8a901b3ce8af2e3b15479fd5455a5c90f22",
      "speaker": "zhizunbao",
      "surface": "group",
      "text": "有啊，俺老孙一听就知道——金箍棒往地上一杵，咚的一声闷响，别人听着是动静，我听着就是到家了。还有一种，城墙根底下卖东西的吆喝远远传过来，不用听清卖什么，光那调子就知道是傍晚、是人间、是热闹的地方。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-30T05:48:50.669313+00:00"
    },
    {
      "declared_kind": "agent",
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "bbd23d41b22640afa8d11f1fea6895f2",
      "recipient": null,
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "group-2026-10-29-evening",
      "source_id": "group",
      "source_index": 1,
      "source_kind": "native_transcript",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/1",
      "source_record_sha256": "d2fdf86008befc454d313782e6b9cbc5fc89e7f3b906818cd6da549e6408e25b",
      "speaker": "qingxia",
      "surface": "group",
      "text": "有。剑出鞘的那一声——不是打起来，是剑刚离鞘、还悬在半空的那一下，轻得很，听见了就知道是自己人回来了，不用回头看。还有一种，是戈壁滩上风过沙丘的声音，沙沙的，一听就知道天快黑了，该找地方坐一会儿了。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-30T05:48:51.382625+00:00"
    },
    {
      "declared_kind": "agent",
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "f41d452adc08460c9cbbbd427b9827d4",
      "recipient": null,
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "group-2026-10-29-evening",
      "source_id": "group",
      "source_index": 4,
      "source_kind": "native_transcript",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/4",
      "source_record_sha256": "dcddfe475dc18604466c597be508868a97032621e3f4ca2864a562ca8a208ac5",
      "speaker": "tangsanzang",
      "surface": "group",
      "text": "有。取经路上，大树底下歇脚时，风过叶子的声音——不是哪一棵树，是走累了坐下来、听见叶子响，就知道可以停一停了。还有一种，是木鱼声停下来的那一下，停了，才听见外面原来还有别的动静。声音先到，人后到；只是前后脚，可心里已经先到了那个地方。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-30T05:48:52.390314+00:00"
    },
    {
      "declared_kind": "agent",
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "c2309e02fc6d480781a1ac162cc7a6bf",
      "recipient": null,
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "group-2026-10-29-evening",
      "source_id": "group",
      "source_index": 3,
